   "question": "<strong>Prove or disprove:</strong> The following function is differentiable at zero:\n\\[ f(x)=\\begin{cases} x\\sqrt{|x|}\\cos(\\frac{1}{x}) &amp; x\\neq 0\\\\ 0 &amp; x=0\\end{cases}. \\]",
